### Get restaurant 1
GET http://localhost:3001/api/restaurants/1

###

### Get restaurant 2
GET http://localhost:3001/api/restaurants/2

###

### Check current session
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/session

###

### Login as restaurant 1
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "password": "pizza123"
}

###

### Check session after logging in as restaurant 1
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/session

###

### Create a menu item for restaurant 1
POST http://localhost:3001/api/menu-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pizza",
  "price": 14.99,
  "description": "Pepperoni pizza"
}

###

### Successfully update restaurant 1's menu item
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/menu-items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Large Cheeseburger",
  "price": 16.99,
  "description": "Fresh beef, cheddar, lettuce, tomato, and extra toppings"
}

###

### Get restaurant 1
GET http://localhost:3001/api/restaurants/1

